<!DOCTYPE component>
<import src="../components/studytable.heml" as="studytable" />
<import src="../components/back-button.heml" as="back-button" />
<properties>

</properties>
<component>
    <div id="outermost-container">
        <back-button />
        <h1>Current Status Of My Education</h1>
        <p class="text-block">
            In this education year, I need to achive 60 
            <a
                href="https://education.ec.europa.eu/education-levels/higher-education/inclusive-and-connected-higher-education/european-credit-transfer-and-accumulation-system">
                ECT</a>s.
            In order to do so, I will have to complete my exams, test, team assignments etc.
            A detailed dashboard of it's current status will be display here. 
            <span class="alt-text">(Which I activly will be updating troughout the year.)</span>
        </p>
        <div class="row-container">
            <h4>Current ECT balance: </h4>
            <div class="progress-bar">
                <div></div>
                <div class="no-fill"></div>
                <div class="no-fill"></div>
                <div class="no-fill"></div>
                <div class="no-fill"></div>
            </div>
            <p>[<span class="thin-text">0/60</span>][<span class="thin-text">%0</span>]</p>
        </div>
        <div style="width: 50rem;" class="divider vertical-space"></div>
        <studytable />
    </div>
</component>